      hu: ["A parkot 1958-ban alapították, és közvetlenül a thaiföldi határ mellett fekszik.", "A 'Xieng Khuan' név magyar jelentése körülbelül 'Szellemek városa'.", "Bunleua Sulilat később egy hasonló parkot (Sala Keoku) is épített Thaiföldön.", "A háromfejű elefánton, Erawanon lovagló Indra isten szobra az egyik legismertebb.", "A tök alakú épület körülbelül hat méter magas, belső tereit szobrok díszítik.", "Minden szobrot képzetlen munkások készítettek Sulilat közvetlen irányítása alatt."],
      ro: ["Parcul a fost fondat în 1958 și se află chiar la granița cu Thailanda.", "Numele „Xieng Khuan” se traduce prin „Orașul Spiritelor”.", "Bunleua Sulilat a construit ulterior un parc similar (Sala Keoku) în Thailanda.", "Statuia zeului Indra pe elefantul cu trei capete Erawan este una dintre cele mai faimoase.", "Clădirea în formă de dovleac are o înălțime de aproximativ șase metri.", "Toate sculpturile au fost realizate de meșteșugari necalificați sub îndrumarea lui Sulilat."],
      en: ["The park was founded in 1958 and is located right on the border with Thailand.", "The name 'Xieng Khuan' can be translated as 'Spirit City' in the Lao language.", "Bunleua Sulilat later built a similar park called Sala Keoku across the river in Thailand.", "The statue of Lord Indra riding the three-headed elephant Erawan is a major highlight.", "The pumpkin-shaped building stands approximately six meters high.", "All sculptures were handcrafted by unskilled laborers under Sulilat's direct supervision."],
